{
  "key": 8267,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0911_C03R0602_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "The Oreburgh Mine is operated\n",
        "with the utmost care.\r",
        "We avoid causing any damage to\n",
        "the natural habitats of Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0911_C03R0602_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow... Your Pokémon’s eyes are\n",
        "twinkling brightly!\r",
        "Seeing that makes me happy!\n",
        "Here, I want you to have this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0911_C03R0602_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "You know how Pokémon stay inside\n",
        "their Poké Balls?\r",
        "I try to think about what would be\n",
        "the best Poké Balls for them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0911_C03R0602_00003",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0911_C03R0602_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "The whole system of taking the coal\n",
        "out of the mine is automated.\r",
        "There’s nothing backbreaking about\n",
        "it!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}